Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:10.43,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,An E-Rank hunter taking a carrier job \Nin an A-Rank dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.45,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Does he think he's invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.79,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:18.48,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Thinking back to yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:21.68,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I saw him in front \Nof the boss room with a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:23.48,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,That's suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.29,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be going in for a bit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:29.27,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen in the dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:31.80,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's personal business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.52,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:41.24,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but do you have a weapon I can borrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:46.40,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:50.70,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Would there happen to be anything else? \NLike a sword or a spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:52.86,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Not around here, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:55.23,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd prefer a shovel or a crowbar, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:57.83,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind, then. I'll just get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:03.67,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Cha, are you really \Ngoing in empty-handed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:10.74,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,I know it's not much, \Nbut it's better than nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:11.91,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.26,Default,Shin Seokjin,0000,0000,0000,,There's so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.78,Default,Shin Seokjin,0000,0000,0000,,If this many high orcs were to \Nbreak out of the dungeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:15.88,Default,Seo Jiwoo,0000,0000,0000,,They could flatten a city or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:17.84,Default,Lee Geonguk,0000,0000,0000,,Those four in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:21.51,Default,Lee Geonguk,0000,0000,0000,,They've got a lot more aura \Nthan the other high orcs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:30.50,DefaultItalics,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,It's our job to make sure the gate closes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:33.82,DefaultItalics,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,If nothing else, we have to make sure \Nthe dungeon boss goes down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:37.72,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Do you fear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:41.55,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,pitiful humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:45.88,DefaultItalics,Gina,0000,0000,0000,,This is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:48.50,DefaultItalics,Gina,0000,0000,0000,,How does he have so much magic power?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:53.59,DefaultItalics,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,Compared to him, it's like I'm a \Nthird-rate spellcaster at best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:58.42,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Why did you call us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:00.01,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,For entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:06.03,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,You will be killed, tortured, \Nand devoured one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.03,0:04:09.17,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,For the enjoyment of my soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:12.11,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Entertainment?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:18.47,DefaultItalics,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,That's all he thinks we're good for? \NAll our lives amount to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:22.78,DefaultItalics,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,We're nothing more than toys for \Nthem to break and then discard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.00,0:04:27.95,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? There seems to be something \Nstrange mixed in with the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:31.12,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,It should make for an interesting diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:33.92,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.68,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:54.19,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:56.07,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Antigravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:00.82,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Gravity Acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:03.70,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:11.16,Default,Kim Eunsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Kihoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:24.64,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Captain Son. The Hunters Guild \Nhas the rights to this dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:26.64,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I really shouldn't get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:31.35,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,But the strike team is in real danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:35.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm going to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:43.91,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay if I take all of these magic beasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:51.58,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Please... do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:57.95,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Not unlike a monkey's mimicry... \Nand no more intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:07.30,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll admit, I've never seen anyone with \Nan aura as intense as yours before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.01,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:12.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Unfortunately, this is a terrible matchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:14.51,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,And when I say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:22.52,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I mean for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:30.08,Default,Mok Jinsoo,0000,0000,0000,,The Surveillance Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:32.03,Default,Workers,0000,0000,0000,,What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:33.60,Default,Workers,0000,0000,0000,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.97,Default,Workers,0000,0000,0000,,Someone call a supervisor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:40.13,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Why was he working as a miner here? \NAnd for two days, at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:41.87,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:45.01,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Is a hunter named Sung Jinwoo working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:46.72,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,You're looking for Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:50.54,Default,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it! I knew that guy was sketchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:53.88,Default,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,He gave me the scariest look I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:56.92,Default,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,I thought he was gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:58.65,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,So, is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.81,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,He's inside the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:04.20,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,They were short on carriers, \Nso he was asked to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:05.39,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,To carry their bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:06.24,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:09.13,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,From mining to carrying bags, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:10.23,DefaultTop,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,He went in as a bag carrier, \Nbut I know he's up to something in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:13.59,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Being an S-Rank makes you a target \Nfor ongoing surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.23,0:07:11.91,DefaultTop,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,Probably murdered somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:13.94,DefaultTop,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,He looks like he could do it \Nwithout blinking an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:15.46,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,I hope he realizes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:15.46,DefaultTop,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,You should've seen the look he gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:18.18,DefaultTop,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,Hell, I bet he's already got a huge body count!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:17.32,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:19.62,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Watch the news tomorrow, \Nand you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:20.75,Default,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,The news?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:25.34,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,It's just, Hunter Cha asked me \Nthe same question earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:22.73,DefaultTop,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,This is what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:24.59,DefaultTop,Lee Seong-gu,0000,0000,0000,,Throw that asshole in jail already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.09,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Cha?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:32.99,Default,Surveillance A,0000,0000,0000,,What in the world?! \NThat's some extraordinary aura!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:35.17,Default,Surveillance B,0000,0000,0000,,It felt like it was going to tear me apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:36.90,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Measure the magic power again. Fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:38.03,Default,Surveillance Team,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:45.67,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:50.99,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea how Kihoon's team \Nmanaged to beat this many high orcs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:55.19,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,but if the magic power I just sensed \Nis coming from the dungeon boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:58.66,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,They could all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.05,0:08:05.48,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,You must be a fool to confront my army \Nwith one so meager in number!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:08.93,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look down on my guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:12.64,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Monarch's Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:18.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,A job-exclusive skill that I obtained after \Nhitting level 70 in the Demon's Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:23.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,My shadow soldiers have gotten stronger \Nafter our excursion to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.67,Default,Gina,0000,0000,0000,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:27.10,Default,Shin Seokjin,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:29.95,Default,Shin Seokjin,0000,0000,0000,,I can only manage two summons at once, at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.91,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,I've never felt such ominous magic power \Nfrom a human before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:36.33,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:06.99,Default,Lee Geonguk,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:09.62,Default,Kim Eunsoo,0000,0000,0000,,It's like watching the vice guild master...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:13.03,Default,Kim Eunsoo,0000,0000,0000,,Why in the world is someone \Nthis strong working as a carrier?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:16.87,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,My soldiers are around B-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:21.76,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Each high orc's life comes at the cost \Nof four or five of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:24.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I had better chip in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:25.95,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Dragon Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.91,0:09:33.15,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Your soldiers are little more than scarecrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.15,0:09:34.80,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.64,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'd say that goes double for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:41.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Because I can bring mine back \Nas many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:43.19,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:44.86,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.40,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Gravity Acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.48,0:09:54.40,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Antigravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:56.12,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Acceleration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:04.22,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Then I will simply destroy them \Nuntil your magic power is spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.22,0:10:06.15,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,As many times as it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:08.71,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:21.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,He's using his huge store of magic power \Nfor ranged, area-of-effect spells
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:23.27,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,to keep me at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:27.98,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,I'm curious to see how long you will last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:30.44,Default,Surveillance A,0000,0000,0000,,The results are in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:34.59,Default,Surveillance A,0000,0000,0000,,This gate is a higher-end A-Rank, \Nalmost approaching S!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:36.41,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,So the previous measurement was in error.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:39.43,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Contact the Hunters Guild master ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:43.02,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Once we're ready, we'll head in \Nto support the strike team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.35,Default,Bae Yoonseok,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:50.92,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,It seems my soldiers are superior \Nin both quantity and quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:55.48,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,It's only a matter of time \Nbefore your magic power is depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:59.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,A matter of time? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:07.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,It's time I showed you what \Na necromancer can really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.19,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:13.69,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Turning my soldiers into undead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:17.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be my shadows, too, soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:19.16,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,And of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:21.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,That includes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.52,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:31.12,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Would they really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:38.98,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,But then why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.68,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:44.11,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,When my eyes opened in this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:48.44,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,the same command ran through \Nmy head, over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.05,0:11:52.28,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,"Hunt the humans."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:57.65,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,The reasons behind it are of no concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:12:00.61,DefaultItalics,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,I need only heed the command.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.90,0:12:03.95,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:06.58,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Slaughter the interlopers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.98,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,and offer the human carcasses as tribute to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:13.96,Default,Hunter A,0000,0000,0000,,On par with an S-Rank dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:18.21,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Son Kihoon's team \Nwould've been more than capable,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:20.10,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,given the original readings...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:21.68,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,We've been caught horribly off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:24.89,Default,Hunter A,0000,0000,0000,,If there's a dungeon break, \Nit'll be Jeju Island all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:27.35,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Thankfully, we still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:31.08,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Gather our guild's strongest forces, \Nand we'll head there at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:37.40,Default,Hunter A,0000,0000,0000,,The emergency call's already gone out \Nto all A-Rank hunters and above.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:39.41,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,In the worst-case scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:43.78,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,we may have to call for assistance \Nfrom the White Tigers and Reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:45.03,Default,Hunter A,0000,0000,0000,,But if we do that...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:49.00,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do our best to ensure \Nit doesn't come to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:23.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like my personal guards have the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:26.24,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,This can't be happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:28.28,Default,Myung-chul,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:29.16,Default,Shin Seokjin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:32.15,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of High Fever! Song of Blindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:36.46,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,You are the audience. \NDo not presume to take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.41,0:13:43.13,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,And I've had just about enough \Nof {\i1}your{\i0} insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:46.39,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Sleep! Song of Impediment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.39,0:13:48.60,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Blindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:49.76,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,What...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:54.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to tell you, but I'm pretty \Nresistant to curses and poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:58.02,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:03.49,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna shatter that annoying shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.61,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:30.40,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Are those his summons? But there's so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.77,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,Vice Guildmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.43,0:14:34.86,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.86,0:14:36.00,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.78,Default,Han Semi,0000,0000,0000,,The captain's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:38.90,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:42.70,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,But what in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:45.24,Default,Han Semi,0000,0000,0000,,We're not sure ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:47.73,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:51.20,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Rage! Song of Strength! Song of Giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:56.46,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Be crushed like the insect you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:15:00.42,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Gotta say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:03.63,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not too fond of giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:05.38,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,So this really gets on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.84,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Dragon Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:30.53,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Do you still dare to defy \Nthe mighty Kargalgan after that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:31.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:43.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,The bigger the target, the easier it is to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:45.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Did you really think a spellcaster
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:49.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,could fend off an assassin's attack \Nwithout extra protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:54.06,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,Song of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.26,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,If the dagger isn't enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:11.39,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:32.64,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Manager Woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:35.64,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,I see everyone's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:40.13,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,We came to aid the strike team after \Nsensing an incredible magic power...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:43.81,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,but it seems there was no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:46.67,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,The Surveillance Team's manager, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:52.68,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,He seems like a top-class combat hunter, \Nbut he can use summoning magic, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:57.20,DefaultItalics,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung is this strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:59.68,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Who in the world is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:02.31,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,You know him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:04.96,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,We're acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.67,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,But only in passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:14.85,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,When spellcasters lose their protection, \Nthey're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:16.68,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,This body....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:19.89,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,This body of mine cannot \Npossibly be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:24.47,Default,Kargalgan,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:46.63,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I know I beat the boss, but taking \Nall the drops might be a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.63,0:17:50.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt they'll mind me extracting \Nhis shadow, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:51.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:01.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like becoming a shadow \Nmellowed you out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,A name? What was his again...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:08.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Kar... something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:10.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I forgot. \NI'll just give you a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:12.58,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:14.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Your name is Tusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:19.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,"Elite Knight" rank? Never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.94,0:18:22.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Makes sense, for an A-Rank dungeon boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:27.38,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,These high orc soldiers are going to \Nmake a huge difference, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.53,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:32.42,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Manager Woo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:35.63,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,I was so focused on collecting \Nthe shadows I didn't notice him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:36.90,Default,Lee Geonguk,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:39.76,Default,Han Semi,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were a carrier... \NWhat was all of that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.35,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:42.85,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,What do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:46.24,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,I'm with Hunter Association surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:51.57,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,This is Hunter Sung Jinwoo, \Nand his status is top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.31,0:18:56.41,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,I need to ask you all to keep what's \Nhappened here today confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:18:58.75,Default,Surveillance A,0000,0000,0000,,We'll escort you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:02.21,Default,Surveillance B,0000,0000,0000,,This is the best way \Nto avoid any more attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:10.12,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Sung displayed S-Rank ability \Nwhen saving you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:13.85,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you'll cooperate \Nwith him making a quiet exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:19.01,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:26.40,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Considering your strength, \NI'm sure you have your reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:29.98,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,I won't ask why you volunteered \Nto carry our equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.17,0:19:37.28,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,But it's because of you \Nthat we all survived, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:41.24,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,As the captain of this strike team, \NI want to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.23,0:19:47.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:50.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,You can have this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.00,Default,Woo Jinchul,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.43,0:19:59.90,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, Vice Guildmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.05,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:03.92,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you have a pickax?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.23,0:20:08.98,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think he thought I was weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:10.53,Default,Lee Bora,0000,0000,0000,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:13.63,Default,Cha Hae-in,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... Uh, no one in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:19.45,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,It's a relief that everyone made it out safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:25.91,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,That said... First the White Tigers, \Nand now he's come to our rescue, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:30.92,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,The ability to summon a number of soldiers, \Nspeed comparable to an assassin type,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.80,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,and on top of that, the ability \Nto control dead magic beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.92,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:42.17,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Hunter Son, who would you say is stronger \Nbetween myself and Hunter Sung Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:50.83,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,In raids, hunters of different types \Nwork together
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:53.48,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,to compensate for individual weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.77,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,I've always believed that was \Nstandard operating procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:21:04.22,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Guildmaster, do you think you could clear \Na higher-end A-Rank dungeon by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:07.57,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:12.19,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,Which is embarrassing, considering all the \Ntalk of me being the "ultimate weapon."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:14.64,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,Guildmaster—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.48,0:21:16.92,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.60,Default,Son Kihoon,0000,0000,0000,,We need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.84,Default,Choi Jong-in,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:27.37,Default,Yoo Jinho,0000,0000,0000,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:32.27,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:37.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,So, how'd the guild master business go? \NDid you and your dad sort it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:40.24,Default,Yoo Jinho,0000,0000,0000,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:43.36,Default,Yoo Jinho,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I'd like to discuss \Nwith you regarding that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:47.41,DefaultTop,Reporter,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here at the Hunter's Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:48.28,Default,Lee Minsung,0000,0000,0000,,I'm loving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:51.25,DefaultTop,Reporter,0000,0000,0000,,Just the other day, the actor \NLee Minsung was confirmed as...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:52.08,Default,Lee Minsung,0000,0000,0000,,They're all here for me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:55.98,Default,Lee Minsung,0000,0000,0000,,The man who has it all, Lee Minsung.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:22:00.05,Default,Lee Minsung,0000,0000,0000,,And now I'm superhuman, to top it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.57,0:22:03.87,Default,Lee Minsung,0000,0000,0000,,Not bad at all.
